### LISTA DE EXAMES SEM FILTRO
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exame
Authorization: token
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE EXAMES COM FILTRO DE NOME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exame?nome=uréia
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE EXAMES COM FILTRO DE NOME DO TIPO DE EXAME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exame?tipoExame=urina
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE EXAMES COM FILTRO DO ID DO TIPO DE EXAME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exame?tipoExameId=5fb7fde4-f551-48ca-bf7a-36ad28b7dc12
Accept: application/json